  "description": "A sudden nightmare strikes!\nThe mischievous mad scientist Anemone has turned Octo and friends into stone…!?\nTo save them, weapon-obsessed scientist Toad sets off on a dangerous climb using his custom-built hopping machine—the Soul Hopper.\n\nThis spin-off mini-game from Goonya Monster stars series favorite Toad.\n…Putting yourself through all that for your friends isn’t so bad, right?\n\n◇ Simple controls!\nCharge your jump by pressing the button the moment you land.\nAdjust your angle while charging, then release to launch yourself into a powerful leap!\n\n◆ Two difficulty modes!\nChoose between Easy and Hard modes.\nPick the challenge that suits your playstyle… or push yourself to the limit!\n\n◆ Bounce, crash, and fall…（修正版）\nEvery mistake can send you crashing back down—but each attempt gets you a little further.\nStay patient, learn the angles, and keep climbing.\nPersistence is the only way to reach the top.\n\n◆ A climb full of hazards\nCrumbling platforms, burning footholds, and more stand in your way.\nWhat you need is courage—and perfect timing.\nTake the leap for your friends!\n\n◇ Battle mode (Local 2-player mode)\nIn Battle mode, the mastermind behind it all—Anemone—joins the fray from Goonya Monster!\nUse your Soul Hopper to collect more coins than your opponent before time runs out.\nSmash into your rival to steal their coins—sometimes, aggression is the best strategy!",
